n while you are testing your code (and you aren't building a larger program), use `print(x * 2)` instead of `return`. \n*   **Think in Modules:** As you get more advanced, try to think of your code as a series of small \"tools\" (functions) that do one specific job. This will make your code much easier to debug!\n\nKeep up the great work! Feel free to ask if you have more questions.",
